  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供图像处理能力，包括格式转换、缩放、裁剪、旋转、翻转、滤镜效果、水印添加、EXIF 读写、颜色空间转换、批量处理等功能。支持 PNG/JPEG/GIF/BMP/WebP/TIFF 等格式。",
    "en-US": "Image processing including format conversion, resize, crop, rotate, flip, filters, watermarks, EXIF read/write, color space conversion, and batch processing. Supports PNG/JPEG/GIF/BMP/WebP/TIFF."
  }
